{"type":"message","id":"08fb023c","parentId":"acb2f71b","timestamp":"2026-04-13T14:39:31.762Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52e44f7ef8a4eea1b257d69a9a8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-13 14:39 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b52e44f7ef8a4eea1b257d69a9a8]\n听风: docker 安装的，能直接 openclaw update？"}],"timestamp":1776091171740}}
{"type":"message","id":"b69003d8","parentId":"08fb023c","timestamp":"2026-04-13T14:39:57.668Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问的是 docker 安装的 OpenClaw 能不能直接 `openclaw update`。\n\nDocker 安装的通常不能直接用 `openclaw update` 命令更新镜像本身，因为：\n1. Docker 容器内的更新命令可能无法更新宿主机的镜像\n2. 通常需要重新拉取镜像，然后重新创建容器\n\nDocker 环境下升级 OpenClaw 的正确方式应该是：\n1. 拉取最新镜像：`docker pull openclaw/openclaw:latest` 或相应标签\n2. 停止旧容器\n3. 删除旧容器\n4. 用新镜像重新创建容器，挂载原来的数据卷（workspace、config 等）\n\n我需要给用户清晰的建议。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Docker 安装的不能直接 `openclaw update` 更新镜像本身。\n\n**Docker 升级方式：**\n\n```bash\n# 1. 拉取最新镜像\ndocker pull openclaw/openclaw:latest\n\n# 2. 停止并删除旧容器\ndocker stop <container_name>\ndocker rm <container_name>\n\n# 3. 重新创建容器（挂载原来的数据和配置）\ndocker run -d \\\n  --name openclaw \\\n  -v /your/path/to/workspace:/workspace \\\n  -v /your/path/to/config:/config \\\n  openclaw/openclaw:latest\n```\n\n**关键：** 重新创建容器时确保挂载原来的 workspace 和 config 卷，这样你的设置、技能、memory 都在。\n\n你现在的容器名和挂载路径是什么？我可以帮写具体命令。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776091171763,"responseId":"021776091173375e4feb8d226730241afb8b5c4c4c35b3253a8b0"}}
